    "brief": {
      "headline": "CELU has negative cash runway of -1.3 months and 21.0M shares of total overhang",
      "bullets": [
        "Estimated current cash is -$1.4M with a quarterly operating burn of $3.3M, leaving -1.3 months of runway.",
        "Total overhang of 21.0M potential shares represents 73% of the 28.9M shares outstanding.",
